			"notes": "## 更新日志 / Changelog\n\n**新增 / Added**\n- 新增游戏规则 `cancelblockupdate:stack_slabs`（默认 `true`）：允许半砖堆叠成双层半砖；可用 `/gamerule cancelblockupdate:stack_slabs false` 关闭。\n- New gamerule `cancelblockupdate:stack_slabs` (default `true`): allows stacking slabs into double slabs; disable with `/gamerule cancelblockupdate:stack_slabs false`.\n\n**修复 / Fixed**\n- 修复半砖（台阶）无法堆叠成双层半砖的问题。\n- Fixed slabs not being stackable into double slabs.\n\n**版本 / Versions**\n- 支持 Minecraft 1.19.2 ~ 26.2（9 个版本分支均通过 CI 构建）。\n- Supports Minecraft 1.19.2 ~ 26.2 (all 9 version branches built successfully via CI)."
		},
